'''Basket of Hope From the Great Potato War''' is a {{Special}} [[Memento]] from [[The Great Potato War]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Basket of Hope From the Great Potato War''' was rewarded to players in the top 1000 in the [[Potato#Collection|Potato Collection]] by the end of [[The Great Potato War]]. Players who are awarded the item have their name on the item as well as their position in the top 1000. This item is now unobtainable and will probably not be added back into the game.

== Trivia ==
* This is currently the item with second longest name in the game, counting 40 characters (including spaces), just after "[[Travel Scrolls|Travel Scroll to Spider's Den Top of Nest]]", which has 41 characters.
* The item is designed to look like a basket containing potatoes.

